WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.048
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:22.096
Open the one-time adjustment. Choose One-time fee / credit. This changes the ledger once and leaves recurring tuition unchanged.

00:00:22.096 --> 00:00:34.558
Enter the approved amount and service date. A positive 50 entered as a credit lowers the example balance from $250 to $200. The selected action controls the sign.

00:00:34.558 --> 00:00:45.606
Add a clear statement note. Include the service week and policy reason. Keep medical or other sensitive child details out of the billing note.

00:00:45.606 --> 00:00:59.033
Review before saving. Confirm the family, amount and projected balance. After an authorized post, verify one ledger entry and unchanged recurring tuition. No credit is posted here.

